.nf
YASMV manual                                                clear

.ti 0
SYNOPSIS

.in 3
clear


.ti 0
DESCRIPTION

.fi
.in 3
Clears all current assignments to environment variables. This command
removes all user-defined variable assignments from the environment,
resetting it to an empty state.

.ti 0
EXAMPLES

.nf
>> clear


